  <Callout kind="remember">
    Each reel walks start, spin, stop on its own, and the controller only
    decides when it may move from one to the next. Nothing stops before the
    result is in and the minimum spin time has passed; after that, the stop
    delay spreads the landings and the tease adds the hesitation. A slam
    cancels a phase outright; a quicken only removes the waiting.
  </Callout>
</Architecture>
